# Phase 14 — Acceptance Criteria

Login implementation is considered done when:

```txt
users table exists
seeded users can login
passwords are hashed
wrong credentials are rejected
inactive users cannot login
JWT token is returned on successful login
GET /api/v1/auth/me returns current user from token
GET /api/v1/auth/me rejects missing/invalid token
password_hash is never returned to frontend
```

